### Alle Mitglieder
GET http://localhost:8080/members

### Alle Übungen
GET http://localhost:8080/exercises

### Workouts von Mitglied 1
GET http://localhost:8080/members/1/workouts

### Gesamtvolumen von Mitglied 1
GET http://localhost:8080/members/1/volume

### Neues Workout starten
POST http://localhost:8080/workouts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "memberId": 1, "date": "2026-11-03" }

### Satz hinzufügen (Workout-ID aus der Antwort oben)
POST http://localhost:8080/workouts/4/sets
Content-Type: application/json

{ "exerciseId": 1, "reps": 8, "weight": 70 }

### Ungültiger Satz -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/workouts/4/sets
Content-Type: application/json

{ "exerciseId": 1, "reps": 0, "weight": 70 }

### Workout löschen
DELETE http://localhost:8080/workouts/4

### 1-Rep-Max berechnen
GET http://localhost:8080/calculator/one-rep-max?reps=8&weight=60

### Stärke-Einstufung
GET http://localhost:8080/calculator/strength-level?oneRepMax=90&bodyWeight=75
